0–100"}]]}],["$","tr","Competency|Process level — the AI-independent ju",{"className":"border-b border-[var(--border-subtle)] last:border-0 print:break-inside-avoid","children":[["$","td","0",{"className":"py-2.5 pr-4 align-top leading-[1.6] font-medium text-[var(--text-primary)]","children":"Competency"}],["$","td","1",{"className":"py-2.5 pr-4 align-top leading-[1.6] text-[var(--text-secondary)]","children":"Process level — the AI-independent judgment (how they reason, verify, frame, and self-regulate) that holds as tools change."}],["$","td","2",{"className":"py-2.5 pr-4 align-top leading-[1.6] text-[var(--text-secondary)]","children":"0–100"}]]}],["$","tr","Construct scores|14 constructs across 3 competen",{"className":"border-b border-[var(--border-subtle)] last:border-0 print:break-inside-avoid","children":[["$","td","0",{"className":"py-2.5 pr-4 align-top leading-[1.6] font-medium text-[var(--text-primary)]","children":"Construct scores"}],["$","td","1",{"className":"py-2.5 pr-4 align-top leading-[1.6] text-[var(--text-secondary)]","children":"14 constructs across 3 competencies, each supported by cited evidence from the work."}],["$","td","2",{"className":"py-2.5 pr-4 align-top leading-[1.6] text-[var(--text-secondary)]","children":"0–5 (or “insufficient evidence”)"}]]}]]}]]}]}],["$","p","Every construct score is tied to specifi",{"className":"mt-4 text-[14px] leading-[1.75] text-[var(--text-secondary)] [text-wrap:pretty]","children":"Every construct score is tied to specific evidence. Where the evidence is insufficient, the system records “insufficient evidence” rather than a low score."}]]]}]
1e:["$","section","5",{"id":"clause-5","className":"relative scroll-mt-24 border-t border-[var(--border-subtle)] pl-9 pt-7 first:border-t-0 sm:pl-14 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-9","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"absolute left-0 top-[1.75rem] font-mono text-[13px] tabular-nums text-[var(--text-muted)] sm:text-[14px]","aria-hidden":true,"children":[5,"."]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"m-0 font-serif text-[20px] font-bold tracking-[-0.01em] text-[var(--text-primary)]","children":"How it is scored"}],[["$","ul","Two-stage scoring: first identify observ",{"className":"mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-[14px] leading-[1.75] text-[var(--text-secondary)] marker:text-[var(--brand)]","children":[["$","li","Two-stage scoring: first identify observable evidence, then combine that evidence to infer a level — no “overall impression” judgments.",{"children":"Two-stage scoring: first identify observable evidence, then combine that evidence to infer a level — no “overall impression” judgments."}],["$","li","Explicit criteria: every rubric reduces to a defined observable variable with inclusion/exclusion thresholds.",{"children":"Explicit criteria: every rubric reduces to a defined observable variable with inclusion/exclusion thresholds."}],["$","li","Three-valued logic: each criterion is confirmed-true, confirmed-false, or undeterminable — the last is distinct from a failure.",{"children":"Three-valued logic: each criterion is confirmed-true, confirmed-false, or undeterminable — the last is distinct from a failure."}],["$","li","Unobserved is never penalized: a behavior that was not observed is flagged for human review, not scored as absent.",{"children":"Unobserved is never penalized: a behavior that was not observed is flagged for human review, not scored as absent."}],["$","li","Multi-source corroboration: no single signal is decisive; the submitted deliverable wins on conflicts about the result.",{"children":"Multi-source corroboration: no single signal is decisive; the submitted deliverable wins on conflicts about the result."}]]}]]]}]
1f:["$","section","6",{"id":"clause-6","className":"relative scroll-mt-24 border-t border-[var(--border-subtle)] pl-9 pt-7 first:border-t-0 sm:pl-14 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-9","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"absolute left-0 top-[1.75rem] font-mono text-[13px] tabular-nums text-[var(--text-muted)] sm:text-[14px]","aria-hidden":true,"children":[6,"."]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"m-0 font-serif text-[20px] font-bold tracking-[-0.01em] text-[var(--text-primary)]","children":"Human oversight"}],[["$","p","The employer reviews the report and make",{"className":"mt-4 text-[14px] leading-[1.75] text-[var(--text-secondary)] [text-wrap:pretty]","children":"The employer reviews the report and makes the decision. Evaluation logic is authored and changed under review. Low-evidence and conflicting signals are surfaced for a human rather than resolved silently."}]]]}]
20:["$","section","7",{"id":"clause-7","className":"relative scroll-mt-24 border-t border-[var(--border-subtle)] pl-9 pt-7 first:border-t-0 sm:pl-14 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-9","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"absolute left-0 top-[1.75rem] font-mono text-[13px] tabular-nums text-[var(--text-muted)] sm:text-[14px]","aria-hidden":true,"children":[7,"."]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"m-0 font-serif text-[20px] font-bold tracking-[-0.01em] text-[var(--text-primary)]","children":"Limitations"}],[["$","ul","Results describe performance on one task",{"className":"mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-[14px] leading-[1.75] text-[var(--text-secondary)] marker:text-[var(--brand)]","children":[["$","li","Results describe performance on one task and may not generalize to every aspect of a role.",{"children":"Results describe performance on one task and may not generalize to every aspect of a role."}],["$","li","Assessment of work done with AI depends on the quality and completeness of the captured session signals.",{"children":"Assessment of work done with AI depends on the quality and completeness of the captured session signals."}],["$","li","Like any AI system, the underlying models can make mistakes; this is why evidence is cited and human review is required.",{"children":"Like any AI system, the underlying models can make mistakes; this is why evidence is cited and human review is required."}],["$","li","The system is not a measure of a person's worth, intelligence, or fixed ability.",{"children":"The system is not a measure of a person's worth, intelligence, or fixed ability."}]]}]]]}]
21:["$","section","8",{"id":"clause-8","className":"relative scroll-mt-24 border-t border-[var(--border-subtle)] pl-9 pt-7 first:border-t-0 sm:pl-14 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-9","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"absolute left-0 top-[1.75rem] font-mono text-[13px] tabular-nums text-[var(--text-muted)] sm:text-[14px]","aria-hidden":true,"children":[8,"."]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"m-0 font-serif text-[20px] font-bold tracking-[-0.01em] text-[var(--text-primary)]","children":"Fairness and evaluation"}],[["$","p","The design choices above — evidence-base",{"className":"mt-4 text-[14px] leading-[1.75] text-[var(--text-secondary)] [text-wrap:pretty]","children":"The design choices above — evidence-based scoring, not penalizing the unobserved, excluding protected characteristics and their proxies — are fairness controls. We assess the system for disparate impact and publish a summary when it is independently audited. [Measured performance and demographic-parity results to be added from the current validation and audit.]"}]]]}]
22:["$","section","9",{"id":"clause-9","className":"relative scroll-mt-24 border-t border-[var(--border-subtle)] pl-9 pt-7 first:border-t-0 sm:pl-14 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-9","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"absolute left-0 top-[1.75rem] font-mono text-[13px] tabular-nums text-[var(--text-muted)] sm:text-[14px]","aria-hidden":true,"children":[9,"."]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"m-0 font-serif text-[20px] font-bold tracking-[-0.01em] text-[var(--text-primary)]","children":"Data, privacy, and versioning"}],[["$","p","Inputs and outputs are handled under the",{"className":"mt-4 text-[14px] leading-[1.75] text-[var(--text-secondary)] [text-wrap:pretty]","children":"Inputs and outputs are handled under the Candidate Privacy Notice and Privacy Policy; sub-processors (including AI model providers) are disclosed. This card is versioned; material changes to the assessment update the version and are noted in the Legal Updates archive."}]]]}]
